msgid "⟪k:0⟫............"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫............"

#: scenario5:scenario5_A5ABC44B_1465_43F4_850E_1343EF233D08
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ea18bb8251dfc85d76c4b0d39ddf8db28fff30982d138a794bcf427f4e388be7
#. default-sha256: 9a206fd31ae675b3141086eb75b9e25e39ddf203ac1a5846a8744d683bee09fd
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_A5ABC44B_1465_43F4_850E_1343EF233D08"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫No. Out with the negative thoughts. ⟪k:1⟫Gotta stay positive.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Yeah! He hasn’t tried "
"to chase me out yet."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Non. Arrête avec les pensées négatives. ⟪k:1⟫Tu dois rester positive.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Allez ! Il "
"n’a pas essayé de me chasser, jusque-là."

#: scenario5:scenario5_51CB0B3F_6BE5_4FF3_8496_E69F74237C28
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f66c90a8bc21091d2ef0bbf002f1174fe177c4387e0a4940e85f8acf3072455b
#. default-sha256: ec0afc3ec0b958de0fe1683571a47b082b370604d0cfa49bb73f26321b6758b5
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_51CB0B3F_6BE5_4FF3_8496_E69F74237C28"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I just... ⟪k:1⟫haven’t broken the ice."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫C’est juste que... ⟪k:1⟫je n’ai pas brisé la glace."

#: scenario5:scenario5_F0A004FE_0504_4874_863A_BDC4B1385474
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ea578f7ebfdab73475b62b75f480ced7044d6968ba9419ae96fae1093a78ebb3
#. default-sha256: 28d48d58306a7a462d692da3327e5cda0c0c3b1cfad28874d0948f998ce0cbe0
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_F0A004FE_0504_4874_863A_BDC4B1385474"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I had to stay positive. ⟪k:1⟫Optimistic. ⟪k:2⟫Happy thoughts. ⟪k:3⟫And be myself."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Je devais rester positive. ⟪k:1⟫Optimiste. ⟪k:2⟫Avoir le moral. ⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Ê⟪k:5⟫tre moi-même."

#: scenario5:scenario5_17E15F6A_C5C3_484C_AD9B_E119F8B8A747
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 02a3e884a4cf809632bd0aacab6c1455b7eabf16ba6f1ac32035eab482592aae
#. default-sha256: 2b7cfbaf5171a4f5669662b0a3464a3faa57565a0605dc3b3cfa4b79da55806d
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_17E15F6A_C5C3_484C_AD9B_E119F8B8A747"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫As long as I kept working at it, with enough time, Michel would surely come around and not "
"be so distant."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Si je n’abandonnais pas, avec le temps, Michel se rapprocherait de moi et se montrerait "
"moins distant."

#: scenario5:scenario5_53CFEAC8_81FA_438F_89DC_E760DAC769D9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0b2afaceb4d7a7d17734097f5b944401ded7dfe3ac40833b8536cfd1f2567f38
#. default-sha256: fc22ac728ebb112621ff46002bd561b3893e639c82d97374e4a43e3a45429bc8
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_53CFEAC8_81FA_438F_89DC_E760DAC769D9"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I’ve got a goal, so let’s get to work!⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫First, I make supper, then I ask him to have "
"it with me!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Voilà mon but, alors on se motive !⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫D’abord, je fais à manger pour le dîner, puis "
"je vais lui demander de me rejoindre pour le repas !"

#: scenario5:scenario5_7BF7B634_FCB5_4F5B_AF9C_9DD60B9B5647
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7320effa072d0a1bf15d83324bb833c8ab5962d4cdc6977e9d176b1bdc591339
#. default-sha256: 1a577d1be592a6e0f57ab9c413d61fefab065b409b8a4f81e03253fb4592a8e0
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_7BF7B634_FCB5_4F5B_AF9C_9DD60B9B5647"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Gotta be proactive when it comes to the reclusive types.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫All right, here goes!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Il est du genre renfermé, alors c’est à moi de faire le premier pas.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Allez, c’est "
"parti !"

#: scenario5:scenario5_1833A9EF_9C5F_42E2_A025_321232DDA47F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 366eb118618a80fe63a3b98394de37750810491a36db9288a0207d5172ce8d16
#. default-sha256: 3ff658005fd2878e74703f4cbb4b4779d72f53556a0413d9f1d5081b1941df4f
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_1833A9EF_9C5F_42E2_A025_321232DDA47F"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫...Or, here ⟪k:1⟫would⟪k:2⟫ go..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫...Enfin, c’est ⟪k:1⟫presque⟪k:2⟫ parti..."

#: scenario5:scenario5_B72CDCC4_4A01_424F_85BE_6835A62DB5E3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bd7b3ee55b989157196c8db1283f685451c5923fda4e9764a3b4c58cc63004c4
#. default-sha256: 24e6c8d9ae4e06724aa1fab087ce80bf0b432453e22356fdf9b6bcda19044649
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_B72CDCC4_4A01_424F_85BE_6835A62DB5E3"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫but we’re almost out of supplies."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫...on n’a quasiment plus de provisions."

#: scenario5:scenario5_11BB8136_F92F_4ACC_9734_9C23776BACCA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 37066f1d4ca8628a5aee9c6a1099f308465306538599afbaf0d5df710d4694a3
#. default-sha256: 5ddc2de5003a1a28ca5b3e0082a7b2dbbee76a83cfd206f6466bda0971124d03
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_11BB8136_F92F_4ACC_9734_9C23776BACCA"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Well, so much for that."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Eh bien mince alors !"

#: scenario5:scenario5_412A536C_C679_4625_A4B3_6C6F04C86EBB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f3f3eb42b3ff995c6e5cf197c7624fde34041cb24790271cb9306eb6d48e0166
#. default-sha256: bce4082895a2fca06d5598dd96777530af25311013dc20206e2ac375742eebbc
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_412A536C_C679_4625_A4B3_6C6F04C86EBB"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The cellar was where the nonperishable food was stored. ⟪k:1⟫Dried foods, smoked meats, "
"cheeses, and a small scattering of root vegetables."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Toute la nourriture non périssable était stockée à la cave. ⟪k:1⟫Des aliments séchés, de la "
"viande fumée, du fromage ainsi qu’une petite quantité de légumes racines."

#: scenario5:scenario5_C7595F5B_95E2_4441_AEA9_5031309B1B90
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 63d5e0d33abcd942399d2931d9d24f6035ea47d719986e586ce53b7ab42cfaaf
#. default-sha256: 12f6cbae1f061a60e698b5626d0db6475238ccaa93734750b6203e045c7fb897
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_C7595F5B_95E2_4441_AEA9_5031309B1B90"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Looking at this makes me feel like a soldier holding down a castle’s fortifications."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫En voyant ça, j’eus l’impression d’être un soldat gardant les fortifications du château."

#: scenario5:scenario5_DFC7153C_F91F_4BF4_8171_C97CFDF5C923
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9e4e91fcb5c3349d1920997d5d2954d694d29ac9700537b6d562a2378a504a0f
#. default-sha256: b9d32f067748f5a5a45de7e30ff8c6bbb7d127a5c0b27592dd6f438e97317c0d
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_DFC7153C_F91F_4BF4_8171_C97CFDF5C923"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Had Michel really gone ten years on nothing but this?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I would have raised the white "
"flag long ago."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Michel avait-il vraiment passé dix ans à ne se nourrir que de ça ?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫J’aurais agité "
"le drapeau blanc depuis bien longtemps."

#: scenario5:scenario5_906466F2_7ED7_4E86_95B3_B101047690F5
